After opener's 1NT rebid (12--14 balanced) responder places the contract or
invites: a rebid of responder's own suit or a preference to opener's suit is a
signoff, 2NT and a three-level rebid or jump preference invite, a new suit at
the two level is natural and non-forcing unless it is a reverse (1!m-1!s-1NT-2!h
is a weak 5-4), and a reverse or
a jump shift is a game force (the booklet's own example is 1!c-1!h-1NT-2!s or
3!d). With game values and nothing else to show, responder bids 3NT; with
too little to act, responder passes (NOTES.md #C1).

